WEBVTT

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:19.640
Vintage is flying around in the open,

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:22.060
yet I must hide inside...

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.000
Is everyone else okay?

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:34.930
Goddesses...

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:39.420
If you are present, show yourselves.

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:43.190
Or we will begin interrogating 
all of you, one at a time.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:47.440
If you wish to save these 
girls, reveal yourselves.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.420
Why are you trying to start another war?

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.070
You could loosen your grip on my hand!

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:27.620
We're both invisible.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.310
If we get separated, we won't 
be able to find each other.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:32.230
Do you know where Ayumi is?

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:34.570
Nora's transmitting her location.

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:39.200
Looks like she's in Seaside Park.

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:44.410
Chihiro?

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:45.910
Katsuragi?

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:47.950
I can't see him.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:50.290
Katsura—

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.280
Chihiro, are you okay?

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:17.700
Chihiro?

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:22.110
U-Uh, you only have to put 
up with me a little longer.

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:25.300
I don't really mind...

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:31.070
What was that for?!

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:32.850
Get off me already!

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:33.870
Let's go.

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:41.250
Katsuragi, why not just tell Ayumi 
the truth about what's happening?

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:42.340
That won't work.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:43.740
If I tell the truth, I can't conquer her.

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:45.040
You're wrong!

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:47.810
Ayumi's waiting for you to tell her the truth.

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:52.730
Is that the strategy you two devised?

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.980
Wh-What's that supposed to mean?

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.890
<i>I was wondering why Ayumi 
was being so aggressive.</i>

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:03.140
<i>That explains it.</i>

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:14.070
I remember this ship...

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:18.660
But it's strange Vintage hasn't 
noticed her, given our proximity.

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:19.750
I wonder why.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:23.640
Well, regardless, this will 
be the stage for the finale.

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:31.660
<i>Katsuragi...</i>

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:34.150
Ayumi!

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:35.930
Where are you, Ayumi?

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:49.370
<i>He's playing a game.</i>

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:52.950
<i>A game with the goal of seducing you tonight!</i>

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:56.220
<i>But... He has a reason for doing it!</i>

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:57.350
<i>A reason?</i>

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:58.830
<i>I don't know any specifics,</i>

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:01.050
<i>but whatever it is, he's 
desperate to see it through.</i>

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:04.200
<i>If this doesn't make sense, ask him for answers.</i>

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:08.660
<i>You have to decide what you 
want to do with Katsuragi.</i>

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:13.310
<i>Katsuragi, why are you doing this?</i>

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:16.060
<i>Just tell me the truth...</i>

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:19.650
<i>It might be better to tell her everything.</i>

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:23.320
<i>I'm sure Ayumi would be willing to help.</i>

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:29.330
I give up.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:30.590
Huh?

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:32.240
I'm out of ideas.

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:33.830
I'll tell you everything.

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:37.010
But with one condition!

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.710
Right now, I can only answer one question.

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:42.900
I promise to answer one.

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:46.140
But your other questions will have to wait.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.340
Wh-Why do I have to ask questions?

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:49.520
How long do I need to wait?

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:50.720
Is that your question?

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:51.910
If so, I'll answer it.

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:53.360
Shut up!

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:55.450
If you refuse to accept this 
condition, we're done.

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.910
I'll never approach you again.

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:00.780
Will you ask a question?

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:02.540
Or are we through?

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:03.360
Choose.

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:06.360
<i>He wants to keep it from her at all costs?</i>

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:14.650
Diana...

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.670
What is it, Tenri?

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:19.880
Um... So...

00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:26.920
T-Tenri, why did you not say anything before?

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:31.890
Here's my question.

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:35.640
Do you love me?

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:38.650
I do not.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:46.900
Then you've been lying 
to me this whole time?

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:48.840
That's a second question.

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:49.910
I can't answer you.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:53.970
You don't love me, but you chased 
me around and proposed to me?

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:54.660
That's also a second—

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.180
Shut up!

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:57.670
You aren't being fair!

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:00.090
I didn't say that you wouldn't get an answer...

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:00.670
You just have to wait—

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:02.040
Answer me now!

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:05.550
You must have a reason to go through all this!

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:06.550
So...

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:13.310
If you need my help, I'll do what I can...

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:16.730
No, thank you.

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:19.150
I don't need your help.

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:20.500
Especially not now.

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:22.560
You insist on having it your way,

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:24.870
while you ignore how everyone else feels!

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:28.490
How could anyone love someone like you?

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:29.950
You're disgusting!

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:33.910
I'm not doing this because 
I want people to love me.

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:38.750
I'm only trying to reach the ending.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.250
I don't require any reward or assistance.

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:44.000
I won't let anyone else take this responsibility.

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:47.260
This is a gamer's love.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:49.380
Ayumi, I love you.

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:52.930
Take my hand,

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.390
Ayumi.

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:58.660
I will guide you to the ending.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:03.250
As requested, I tried to make it romantic.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:07.030
But it won't take long for them to find us...

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:10.530
<i>Ayumi, please come with me!</i>

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:16.870
Isn't this enough?

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:19.310
Ayumi...

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:24.290
Fine, I guess...

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:27.690
We can have a wedding ceremony.

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:28.800
Wrong answer!

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:30.570
What do you mean, you guess?!

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:32.280
Don't you have anything better?

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:33.760
Do you realize what an ending entails—

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.050
Shut up!

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.990
We just have to do this, right?

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:39.590
No! I don't accept this ending!

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:41.230
You're being too casual about this!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:42.710
Quiet!

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:50.710
Try to smile, you sick freak.

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:52.740
I don't see you smiling, real girl.

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:59.390
Now, let us exchange vows 
before the Maijima Sea!

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:01.220
Don't bother with vows!

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:03.990
I can't trust anything out of your mouth.

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:07.150
Th-This is one nasty bride.

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:08.200
But...

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:12.590
I will trust your feelings.

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:19.160
Earlier, I decided that if you really came 
here, I would trust you no matter what.

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:22.640
I understand how serious you are.

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.110
That's wrong!

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:25.850
That's not what a conquest is.

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:28.520
Why do you think I planned how 
to trigger all those flags?

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:30.660
Shut up! Shut up!

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.900
Just stop talking about conquests!

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.900
Hey, are you getting married or not?

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:37.910
A conquest is more important than the world!

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:42.900
I can't let you take this whole process so lightly!

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:46.170
What do you take me for?

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:47.860
B-Back off...

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:50.700
I've thought desperately about this, too!

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:52.800
I won't let anyone manipulate my feelings!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:55.870
I'm... I'm the one who decided

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:57.500
to fall in love with you!

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:00.270
<i>That's right...</i>

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:03.070
<i>That was the choice I made, too.</i>

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:07.060
If you understand, marry me!

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:45.190
Mercurius...

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:52.780
Hey, wake up!

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:57.820
Thank you, Katsuragi!

00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:59.820
Diana... She has her wings?

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:01.470
Diana?

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:03.450
Mer, thank you for waking up.

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:06.370
I need you to do something right away.

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.330
But I just woke up...

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:14.090
Vintage, this is the end of the road!

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:17.090
The Loose Souls Team will face you!

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:26.730
<i>Limuel?</i>

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:27.860
Akari?

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:31.690
Katsuragi, I appreciate your 
efforts in this endeavor.

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:34.230
You have my gratitude.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:38.630
Some members of the Loose Souls Team 
still refuse to give in to Vintage.

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:40.790
The time has come to show our pride.

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:44.880
We will rescue the captive girls.

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:46.540
Let us take it from here.

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:49.090
Stay together!

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:51.410
We will help reunite the goddesses!

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:56.670
Wasn't that Akari?

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:57.840
What's going on?

00:10:58.400 --> 00:10:59.390
Is it over?

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:05.230
Yeah, I've done my part.

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:08.560
What happened to that thing inside Ayumi?

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:12.750
It grew wings and flew off.

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:14.800
Oh?

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:19.090
I couldn't see a thing...

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:24.100
Then, I'm going home.

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:28.770
I have a concert to play in.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.960
Is it okay for us to just leave?

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.230
Probably not.

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:43.940
But there's nothing we can do to help.

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:47.970
Anyway, why are you coming with me?

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:50.780
I left my guitar at your house!

00:11:50.780 --> 00:11:53.520
I can't play in the concert without it.

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:15.420
The sun's up...

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.350
Here, this was what you wanted?

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:19.550
Thanks.

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.050
Bye.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.180
Chihiro, thanks for everything.

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:28.310
Huh? Are you trying to creep me out?

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:32.060
It's thanks to you that I brought 
out the goddess in Ayumi.

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:35.390
No, I was interfering!

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:38.900
But you didn't tell her about Hell.

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:42.070
If you'd revealed that, it would 
have taken much longer.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.200
That's because...

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:48.490
I didn't understand what was going on.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:51.510
I'm sorry you had to worry about protecting me,

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:53.780
when I wasn't supposed to be involved.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:59.350
Those shadowy figures were after Ayumi, right?

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:02.460
I wasn't even a part of anything.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:05.320
Sorry you had to protect me.

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:39.230
Seems the winds have changed.

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:42.170
That's enough...

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:45.570
You put up a good fight.

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:47.760
I'll let you live.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:49.550
So long.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:56.500
The Katsuragi sister.

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.060
Huh?

00:13:57.630 --> 00:13:59.370
Miss Nikaido?

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:02.040
It should be fine now.

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:04.570
Don't be late for your band performance.

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:05.690
That's all I had to say.

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:06.860
Bye.

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:09.870
Huh? O-Okay...

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:13.960
Why did Miss Nikaido say that?

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:18.200
Wait, I'm Kanon right now...

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:20.130
How did she know it was me?

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:25.120
Say, why did you go on a date

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.630
with me on Festival Eve?

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:32.120
You wouldn't go on a date 
for no reason, would you?

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:37.390
Was there something inside me...

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:40.300
Something inside me, as well?

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:50.410
No, you weren't involved in all that.

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:04.000
That's good!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.710
It would suck if I were actually 
involved in this mess.

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:14.470
Then I never have to talk to you again.

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:17.990
Yeah...

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:28.740
Chihiro, I'll be listening to 
your performance today.

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:31.880
Oh, okay.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:34.620
You'll be amazed by what you hear!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:42.880
Well...

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:46.960
Katsuragi...

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.480
Bye-bye.

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:04.650
Bye-bye...

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:40.720
<b>Mai High Festival, Final Day 
Main Stage: Battle of the Bands</b>

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:40.720
Ellie, Yui, and Ayumi are all missing!

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:42.630
What's going on?

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:45.710
Well, maybe they're running late...

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:47.710
We'll have to start without them.

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:48.850
What are you talking about?!

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:50.470
Today's our show!

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:52.300
Well, let's go!

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:53.490
It's our first on-stage performance.

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:54.890
When's Kanon performing?

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:56.100
There's one more band left.

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:57.000
Did you feel the tremor this morning?

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:58.620
Oh, the next band is up!

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:09.890
Hello, everyone!

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:12.610
We're the 2-B Pencils!

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:15.600
This is our first concert,

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:18.710
but something came up, 
and three members aren't here!

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:19.610
What happened?

00:17:19.610 --> 00:17:21.020
Running late?

00:17:19.610 --> 00:17:21.020
I'll kill them!

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:23.580
So it'll be just the two of us!

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:24.600
Do they know what they're doing?

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.150
Good luck!

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:30.980
<i>The pick...</i>

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:32.760
You can do it!

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:35.940
Well, please listen to our song.

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:37.460
Hold on!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.650
Sorry, Chihiro!

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:44.620
We're a little late...

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:47.190
Welcome back.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:50.510
Stop talking, and get changed!

00:17:50.510 --> 00:17:52.660
Please give us a moment!

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:57.760
What's with that dress? 
Did you get married?

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:00.520
I'm not sure...

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:03.020
Did I do the right thing?

00:18:03.320 --> 00:18:04.880
I don't know the answer,

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:06.940
but didn't you decide it for yourself?

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:10.020
Yeah, I did...

00:18:10.890 --> 00:18:12.820
Then it's okay!

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:15.320
Get your guitar out!

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:24.190
Okay, everyone...

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:26.120
Let's try this again.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:29.870
We're 2-B Pencils!

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:31.700
Glad you could all make it!

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:33.460
Don't be late to your own concert!

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:35.260
Well, it's not a big deal.

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:38.820
Today is part of the festival, after all.

00:18:38.820 --> 00:18:41.280
The Mai High Festival's almost over.

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:43.110
Did you all have some good times here?

00:18:43.110 --> 00:18:45.890
As long as we're here, 
let's make some great memories!

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:51.650
If there's someone you like, 
tell them how you feel!

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:56.650
Okay...

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:57.430
What?

00:18:57.430 --> 00:18:58.610
Look at that!

00:18:58.610 --> 00:18:59.260
Kanon?

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:00.150
No way!

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:01.320
It's Kanon!

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.030
Huh? Why's she here?

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.610
Wow!

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:09.790
Thank you, Chihiro.

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:14.480
Do you mind if I sing with you?

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:15.290
Huh?

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:18.970
You once said that you wanted 
to have a contest with me...

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:22.570
I want to sing with you!

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:56.250
<i>Caught up in this ever-changing life,</i>

00:19:56.250 --> 00:20:02.880
<i>I never thought that I'd experience love.</i>

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:10.150
<i>There's no rhyme or reason to falling in love.</i>

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:15.130
<i>I fell in love.</i>

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:43.510
<i>Those fleeting, precious days</i>

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:48.460
<i>have begun to stir again.</i>

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:56.940
<i>That once-in-a-lifetime moment and sensation</i>

00:20:56.940 --> 00:21:01.530
<i>have faded away.</i>

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:10.120
<i>But in my heart, I'll always have those feelings and</i>

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:14.860
<i>the memory of my first love.</i>

00:21:21.610 --> 00:21:23.720
<i>I'm sorry, Chihiro...</i>

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:29.300
<i>Earlier, that wasn't what I meant to say.</i>

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:47.720
<i>That once-in-a-lifetime moment and sensation</i>

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:53.980
<i>have faded away.</i>

00:21:55.120 --> 00:22:01.500
<i>But in my heart, I'll always have those feelings and</i>

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:05.180
<i>the memory of my first love...</i>

00:22:05.180 --> 00:22:11.690
<i>The memory of my first love.</i>

00:22:31.720 --> 00:22:42.170
<b>The Memory of My First Love</b>

00:22:49.140 --> 00:22:50.430
El!

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:52.440
Look at this...

00:22:52.440 --> 00:22:54.430
A customer gave me these cyclamens.

00:22:54.780 --> 00:22:57.150
Wow, they're pretty.

00:22:57.150 --> 00:22:58.730
Aren't they lovely?

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:01.410
Yes, we should put them in the café!

00:23:03.260 --> 00:23:05.520
<i>Five days have passed since then.</i>

00:23:07.990 --> 00:23:11.240
<i>The members of Vintage were captured,</i>

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:16.180
<i>and their plan to restore Ancient Hell was halted.</i>

00:23:17.980 --> 00:23:20.350
<i>Haqua returned to the Loose Souls Team...</i>

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:21.540
<i>Wait.</i>

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:25.600
You were fired, Haqua?

00:23:25.600 --> 00:23:27.760
S-Stuff happened!

00:23:28.230 --> 00:23:31.880
<i>Also, for her help in defeating Vintage,</i>

00:23:31.880 --> 00:23:33.840
<i>Nora was promoted to Head Section Chief.</i>

00:23:33.840 --> 00:23:35.760
That's just wrong!

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:38.390
<i>And...</i>

00:23:42.710 --> 00:23:44.000
<i>My Exalted Brother...</i>

00:23:52.080 --> 00:23:54.260
<i>...is back to normal.</i>
